    "scenesThatPass": [
      "MARIE: I'm... so... sorry...\nELENA: You will be.",
      "JENNY: Happy birthday, babe. They ain't diamonds, but you're just gonna have to wait for those...\nMARIE: Thank you. Thank you so much...\nJENNY: Are you OK, hon?\nMARIE: I...yeah...I'll be fine...It's just...that new girl...I almost hit her in the parking lot...",
      "ELENA: Bet you choke.\nMARIE: What's your major malfunction?\nELENA: Just wanted to make a wager. Between best friends.\nELENA: You blow this dive, I get those diamonds of yours.",
      "MARIE: Nah. I'm cool.\nJENNY: Denial ain't just a river in Egypt, babe. You got diamonds on the mind.",
      "JENNY: So? Did you get the key? Are you Blue Bay's richest bitch?\nJENNY: Holy shit, who invited her?\nMARIE: This is a private party...\nELENA: Don't mind me. I ain't here for your stupid party."
    ]
